44
00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:33.915
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:33.965 --> 00:02:36.249
Thunder! Well done!

46
00:02:37.312 --> 00:02:43.026
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:43.076 --> 00:02:45.608
Lightning! Well done!

48
00:02:46.479 --> 00:02:48.310
