49
00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:52.645
Put on your raincoat. Put on your rain boots.

50
00:02:52.695 --> 00:02:57.130
Your turn!

51
00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:01.013
Put on your raincoat. Put on your rain boots.

52
00:03:01.912 --> 00:03:07.228
